1
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:42,960
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:46,020
[Episode 23]

3
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,200
You got here so quickly.

4
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:50,039
It caught me off guard.

5
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:52,590
Last time,

6
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:54,870
weren't you whispering sweet nothings
to the fiancée

7
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:56,070
of the marquis's son?

8
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,789
Why are you

9
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:59,070
all alone today?

10
00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:01,800
I actually feel a bit sorry for you.

11
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:02,840
What?

12
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:05,560
Are you now concerning yourself with

13
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,760
my personal affairs?

14
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,840
It was a joke.

15
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,800
I'm just curious to see

16
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:15,430
what kind of man could
capture Fourth Lady Xie's heart

17
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,630
for secret trysts.

18
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,760
The few ships you intercepted today are

19
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:26,170
of little consequence to the Canal Gang.

20
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:28,710
With how ruthlessly you operate,

21
00:02:29,079 --> 00:02:31,120
you'd never leave any loose ends.

22
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,120
So your visit today is

23
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,810
not about the ships.

24
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,590
Take a guess.

25
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,840
What do you think I'm here for?

26
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:46,770
When Shen Zhibai was falsely accused
of major corruption in Hengtang,

27
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:48,470
it shocked the court and the public.

28
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:50,680
The late Emperor ordered an investigation.

29
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,430
All officials in Hengtang
worked hand in glove

30
00:02:52,430 --> 00:02:53,560
to claim that he was

31
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:55,800
using anti-corruption efforts as a facade

32
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,130
to pocket public funds,

33
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:59,000
chief among which was

34
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:01,960
the embezzlement of
canal transport profits.

35
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,560
If you want the truth,

36
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:05,520
I'm afraid you must

37
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,030
come to this dock.

38
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:12,560
For a century, your Pei family
has monopolized

39
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:15,120
the profits from
Hengtang's canal transport.

40
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:17,280
If your family hadn't testified,

41
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,520
this false accusation would never

42
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,180
have been pinned on the Shens.

43
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,590
As expected,

44
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:25,550
you're here to hold my family accountable.

45
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:28,800
Your family didn't actually
conspire with the others,

46
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,400
so you're still redeemable.

47
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:31,680
I'm here to

48
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,590
find evidence against

49
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:37,280
the person pulling the strings
behind your family.

50
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,150
I can

51
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,760
get you the evidence.

52
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:42,870
But

53
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:45,079
it comes with a price.

54
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,440
Give yourself to me.

55
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,660
What do you say?

56
00:03:58,030 --> 00:03:59,120
The largest

57
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:00,600
Eastern Pearl market in Hengtang

58
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,870
is right ahead.

59
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,080
We'll see

60
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:04,500
its shopfront sign soon.

61
00:04:16,089 --> 00:04:20,290
♪ I counted every moment ♪

62
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:24,870
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

63
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:29,200
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

64
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,660
I asked you a question.

65
00:04:29,300 --> 00:04:33,530
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

66
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,320
Qingyuan?

67
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:38,070
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

68
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:36,840
Eastern Pearls, right?

69
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:42,700
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

70
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:40,950
There's a shop here.

71
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:41,680
This shop...

72
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:49,000
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

73
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:46,310
Hello. What are you looking for?

74
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:47,600
Could you

75
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:48,630
show me

76
00:04:48,630 --> 00:04:49,920
your best Eastern Pearls?

77
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:52,800
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

78
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,070
They're all here.

79
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,900
Or shall I help you pick some more?

80
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:58,330
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

81
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,680
I can't just give you

82
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,830
the evidence

83
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:57,120
you want.

84
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:02,610
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

85
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,120
You've been alone for a long time,

86
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,160
so you aren't aware that

87
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,800
in Hengtang, even in the capital,

88
00:05:02,750 --> 00:05:07,010
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

89
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:07,110
families rely on marriage alliances
to strengthen their power.

90
00:05:07,110 --> 00:05:11,030
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

91
00:05:07,430 --> 00:05:09,230
I'll help you find the evidence,

92
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:11,270
and you'll give yourself to me.

93
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:16,080
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

94
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:13,240
It's a reasonable deal.

95
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,160
The Eastern Pearl hairpin
from before broke.

96
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,000
I've been wanting to
give you a better one,

97
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:20,490
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

98
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:20,160
but I could never find the time,

99
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:20,950
until today.

100
00:05:20,650 --> 00:05:24,760
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

101
00:05:21,390 --> 00:05:23,450
But I don't think their stuff is good.

102
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,310
Qingyuan,

103
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,360
actually,

104
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:32,000
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

105
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:27,480
you don't have to rush
to fall in love with me.

106
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,680
After we get married,

107
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,470
we'll have 5 years, 10 years,

108
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:32,000
a lifetime together.

109
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,159
As long as you're willing,

110
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:34,159
I'll wait for you.

111
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:38,510
You want to use the case of Shen Zhibai

112
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:41,720
to implicate Commissioner Hu
in the old case of Hengtang.

113
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,159
It is a brilliant move.

114
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,290
This elegant one suits you better.

115
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:47,830
But I was one step ahead of you.

116
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:49,750
I've already killed off

117
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,240
all the spineless cowards you could use

118
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,750
as a pawn.

119
00:05:57,830 --> 00:06:00,390
Right now, only I can help you.

120
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:06,110
Qingyuan,

121
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:07,400
do you like

122
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,360
this or this?

123
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:11,930
Either's fine.

124
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,920
Either?

125
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:20,360
Mom said if you can't choose,
the options are all bad.

126
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,120
This won't do.

127
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,520
Let's go to the biggest
Eastern Pearl shop!

128
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:44,750
You're truly a rare breed,

129
00:06:45,330 --> 00:06:48,390
unfazed even by the possibility of
the extermination of your clan.

130
00:06:48,390 --> 00:06:49,510
Someone like you

131
00:06:49,950 --> 00:06:51,150
is a worthy opponent.

132
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:53,040
But I forgot to tell you that

133
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:56,120
whoever stands in the way
of me finding the truth

134
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,380
will only have one end,

135
00:06:58,390 --> 00:06:59,360
which is death.

136
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,560
You must be joking.

137
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,560
In a place like Hengtang,

138
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,830
even an imperial edict

139
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,160
carries little weight.

140
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,830
At best,

141
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,430
incoming officials

142
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:15,070
end up like Wei Changyan.

143
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,360
At worst, they

144
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,360
become content with playing dumb

145
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,420
like Prefect Qian.

146
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,270
Only Shen Zhibai would be

147
00:07:22,270 --> 00:07:24,190
so ignorant, reckless, and delusional

148
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:26,870
as to think he could
shake the order of Hengtang.

149
00:07:29,950 --> 00:07:31,510
Hengtang has its own rules.

150
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:33,390
Break the rules,

151
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:34,650
and the price is death.

152
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:37,730
That was the case for Shen Zhibai.

153
00:07:37,830 --> 00:07:38,680
And it will be

154
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,480
the case for you.

155
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:45,310
Well said.

156
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:48,220
But what is hidden must come to light.

157
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,070
Who knows what the rules will look like

158
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,159
down the road?

159
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,750
In the past,

160
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,159
I only found Fourth Lady fascinating.

161
00:07:58,430 --> 00:07:59,560
But now it seems

162
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,450
you're even more interesting.

163
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,680
This matter is too shocking, scandalous,

164
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,750
and unheard of.

165
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,820
Forgive me, but I can't agree.

166
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:18,160
We're both mothers.

167
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,560
I don't believe

168
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,600
you don't know

169
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,480
who is genuinely good to your child.

170
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:27,270
Qingyuan is great

171
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:29,750
and Chunzhi adores her.

172
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,560
However,

173
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:34,000
she is unusually

174
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:35,510
close to Shen Run.

175
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:38,530
If she marries into the marquis's family,

176
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,929
I'm afraid Chunzhi will have to

177
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,650
endure a lifetime of humiliation.

178
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,630
Qingru is different.

179
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,420
They've been close

180
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:54,720
since they were kids.

181
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,900
She's the one who
truly cares about Chunzhi.

182
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,150
If a principal wife

183
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,960
is devoted to the patriarch,

184
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:09,150
the family will

185
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:11,270
surely prosper.

186
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:22,960
My elder brother
happens to be visiting too.

187
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:27,910
He can attend his niece's wedding.

188
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,840
Wouldn't that be wonderful?

189
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,360
Commissioner Hu is coming too?

190
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:51,080
There's still time before
the marriage deed is sent

191
00:09:51,910 --> 00:09:53,390
to the Ministry of Rites.

192
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:58,000
It's a joyous occasion.

193
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,370
His Majesty agreed?

194
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:05,370
His Majesty is already
aware of your meeting

195
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,060
with Yongjia County Lady.

196
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,460
He is willing to give you a chance.

197
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:13,510
You're truly resourceful.

198
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:15,670
It's only been a few days,

199
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:18,480
and you've reported my every move

200
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,030
to His Majesty.

201
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:23,040
Your alliance with Xie Shu
to bring down Hu Xing

202
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,880
is what His Majesty wants to see,

203
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,270
so naturally, he hopes you will maintain

204
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:29,000
close ties with the Xie family.

205
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,870
I was ordered to

206
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,130
relay to you that

207
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:34,150
he's agreed to your request.

208
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,840
But I'm sure you know

209
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,930
what conditions are involved.

210
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:40,630
Whether you accept this favor

211
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,840
is entirely up to you.

212
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,480
My dear,

213
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:16,200
isn't my osmanthus wine good?

214
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:20,360
It's my favorite too.

215
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,910
Once you're married,

216
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,840
you won't really

217
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:30,440
have a chance to visit anymore.

218
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:32,270
My baby.

219
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:33,240
Come on.

220
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,440
I'll drink a little with you.

221
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,200
Don't drink too much.

222
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,480
Silly child.

223
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:54,550
That's not how you drink wine.

224
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:57,270
Slow down.

225
00:11:59,870 --> 00:12:00,600
Granny.

226
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:04,200
I'm just happy.

227
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,690
I'm getting married tomorrow.

228
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,480
Aren't you happy for me?

229
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:15,000
Knowing that you'll have good days ahead,

230
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:16,870
how could I not be?

231
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:22,200
Don't think I don't know

232
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:24,440
what you're really thinking.

233
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:27,360
You're marrying into the marquis's family

234
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,440
not for the heir

235
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,200
but for your mother.

236
00:12:36,030 --> 00:12:37,000
You are

237
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,890
getting married tomorrow.

238
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:41,210
I shouldn't say anything more.

239
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,270
It's just...

240
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:49,960
It's just...

241
00:12:51,550 --> 00:12:52,910
I know full well that

242
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,720
this is the price I have to pay

243
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,840
to seek justice,

244
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,030
but this price...

245
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,320
is really too heavy.

246
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:03,790
Granny,

247
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,030
did I choose the wrong path

248
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,180
and make the wrong choice?

249
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:12,320
Silly girl.

250
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,480
It's okay.

251
00:13:16,030 --> 00:13:17,550
Most people

252
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:20,480
start out not knowing what

253
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,080
they really want.

254
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:24,870
Later, as they move along,

255
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,510
they fall and cry,

256
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:27,750
and think they

257
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:29,720
took the wrong path.

258
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:31,630
In the end,

259
00:13:32,110 --> 00:13:33,240
looking back,

260
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,270
they realize

261
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:37,840
everything was arranged

262
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,720
by heaven long ago,

263
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:44,080
so we can get what we wish for.

264
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,600
It's okay.

265
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,360
But I can't let go.

266
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,240
Granny,

267
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,750
I really can't let go.

268
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,080
It's okay.

269
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,630
I know.

270
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:13,120
I know.

271
00:14:51,670 --> 00:14:52,600
Why are you here?

272
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:55,670
Did you drink?

273
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,930
Why didn't I know you can drink?

274
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:08,600
Get out of my way.

275
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:12,750
What?

276
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:16,290
Did you have to
drink to drown your sorrows

277
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:18,380
when it's your wedding day tomorrow?

278
00:15:25,910 --> 00:15:26,910
I'm happy.

279
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,910
You're lying.

280
00:15:31,750 --> 00:15:32,790
I'm not lying.

281
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,790
I'm beyond happy.

282
00:15:36,750 --> 00:15:37,880
And what about that?

283
00:15:41,050 --> 00:15:47,580
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

284
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:54,290
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

285
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:58,250
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

286
00:15:56,910 --> 00:15:57,840
What do you want?

287
00:15:58,300 --> 00:16:01,500
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

288
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:08,110
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

289
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,870
How could you say you're happy

290
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,970
to marry another man to my face?

291
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:16,000
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

292
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,700
Is it wrong to be happy?

293
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:23,000
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

294
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,390
When you were with the county lady,

295
00:16:20,670 --> 00:16:22,270
you seemed pretty happy too.

296
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:26,820
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

297
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,790
What exactly do you want?

298
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:30,500
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

299
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:30,270
I want to marry you.

300
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:37,120
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

301
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:11,490
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

302
00:17:11,569 --> 00:17:18,490
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

303
00:17:18,609 --> 00:17:22,420
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

304
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:26,000
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

305
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:33,390
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

306
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:40,230
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

307
00:17:40,630 --> 00:17:47,400
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

308
00:17:47,450 --> 00:17:51,280
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

309
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:54,950
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

310
00:17:55,000 --> 00:18:01,260
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

311
00:18:14,550 --> 00:18:15,310
My Lady,

312
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,800
have you really thought it through?

313
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,670
If you've changed your mind,

314
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:20,880
we can help you.

315
00:18:23,510 --> 00:18:24,770
Are you really ready to

316
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:27,010
throw away your life

317
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,440
for revenge?

318
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,590
You clearly like Shen Run—

319
00:18:30,590 --> 00:18:31,590
My mind is made up.

320
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,310
Stop dissuading me.

321
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:46,100
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

322
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:53,330
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

323
00:18:53,390 --> 00:18:59,460
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

324
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:05,200
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

325
00:19:05,220 --> 00:19:11,330
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

326
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:17,520
♪ Through the courtyard, pear blossoms
flutter like snowflakes in a song ♪

327
00:19:17,580 --> 00:19:23,670
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

328
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:30,090
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

329
00:19:30,150 --> 00:19:36,070
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

330
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:33,540
I'll give you one last chance.

331
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:42,290
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

332
00:19:36,270 --> 00:19:37,030
Wait for me.

333
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:39,770
I'll make your wish come true.

334
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:42,590
How long do I have to wait?

335
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:48,260
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

336
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,140
I won't make you wait long.

337
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:48,550
I can't wait.

338
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:54,530
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

339
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:50,680
It's now or never.

340
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,640
This is the last chance.

341
00:19:54,550 --> 00:20:00,550
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

342
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,780
The auspicious hour has arrived!

343
00:20:26,270 --> 00:20:27,350
Lift the sedan.

344
00:20:28,830 --> 00:20:34,660
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

345
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:30,240
Hit the road!

346
00:20:34,690 --> 00:20:40,680
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

347
00:20:40,830 --> 00:20:46,180
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

348
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:51,080
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

349
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:51,240
My biggest dream in life

350
00:20:51,750 --> 00:20:53,720
is to become Chunzhi's wife.

351
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:57,000
But now he's marrying someone else!

352
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,830
What's the point of living?

353
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:02,400
Mother,

354
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,510
I don't want to live anymore!

355
00:21:07,350 --> 00:21:08,880
Just have a good cry.

356
00:21:09,750 --> 00:21:11,270
I told you that

357
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,830
I can protect you for a while,

358
00:21:15,070 --> 00:21:16,870
but I can't protect you forever.

359
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:18,880
You'll have to

360
00:21:20,030 --> 00:21:21,920
shoulder many things on your own.

361
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,930
There is no rush.

362
00:21:24,590 --> 00:21:25,510
Well,

363
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:28,790
the wheel of fortune is still turning.

364
00:21:28,790 --> 00:21:31,400
I don't want to hear
these abstract lectures.

365
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:34,200
He's about to marry someone else.

366
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:36,000
What else can I do?

367
00:21:39,550 --> 00:21:40,640
They have yet to

368
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:43,310
tie the knot, have they?

369
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,070
Bearers?

370
00:22:51,750 --> 00:22:52,950
Yesterday, I dreamed

371
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,940
of the first time I met you, Qingyuan,

372
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:58,030
and today you're my bride.

373
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:01,110
Am I still dreaming?

374
00:23:04,550 --> 00:23:05,440
Who sent you?

375
00:23:06,200 --> 00:23:07,590
Do you know who I am?

376
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:08,830
If you hurt me,

377
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:11,090
none of you will leave Hengtang alive!

378
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:18,050
How much were you paid?

379
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:19,640
I'll pay double.

380
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,240
Miss,

381
00:23:21,550 --> 00:23:23,280
you've already seen our faces.

382
00:23:23,750 --> 00:23:25,000
No amount of money

383
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,510
can save your life.

384
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,200
Just accept your fate and be on your way.

385
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:56,350
Shen...

386
00:23:56,510 --> 00:23:57,310
Shen Che?

387
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:31,200
Thanks for saving me.

388
00:24:32,110 --> 00:24:32,790
Did...

389
00:24:33,270 --> 00:24:34,720
Shen Run send you?

390
00:24:51,440 --> 00:24:53,100
You're marrying someone else

391
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:55,680
and still expect my brother to save you?

392
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:01,110
I didn't come to save you.

393
00:25:01,720 --> 00:25:03,250
I came because I was worried

394
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:05,830
you'd forget the way
to the marquis's residence

395
00:25:05,830 --> 00:25:07,490
and miss the auspicious hour.

396
00:25:08,550 --> 00:25:11,080
You want to make sure
my wedding goes smoothly

397
00:25:11,110 --> 00:25:13,170
so Shen Run can move on from me, right?

398
00:25:14,350 --> 00:25:15,150
That's right.

399
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:16,830
If I kill you,

400
00:25:17,300 --> 00:25:19,830
he'll just pine for you
for the rest of his life.

401
00:25:19,830 --> 00:25:22,090
Only when you become someone else's wife

402
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:23,360
will he truly move on.

403
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:25,920
He made his choice long ago,

404
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:28,000
and I have my own path to walk.

405
00:25:28,100 --> 00:25:29,110
Our paths are different,

406
00:25:29,110 --> 00:25:30,240
so we must part ways.

407
00:25:30,480 --> 00:25:31,940
You don't need to force me.

408
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:32,720
I was on my way

409
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:34,500
to the wedding anyway.

410
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:50,110
The bride has arrived!

411
00:26:25,680 --> 00:26:27,340
Walk upon the carpet squares!

412
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:29,680
Verdant grass drenched in rain and dew!

413
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:31,600
May every step bring blessings,

414
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:33,750
and a noble path

415
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:36,000
lead to endless grace!

416
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,920
Step over the saddle!

417
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,160
May you enjoy

418
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:22,200
peace year after year,

419
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:24,400
and grow old together

420
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:27,000
in lifelong health and peace!

421
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,680
Scatter the five grains!

422
00:27:58,920 --> 00:28:00,920
May the five grains fill your granaries,

423
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:03,050
and blessings overflow the universe!

424
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:05,410
May your family be auspicious,

425
00:28:05,510 --> 00:28:08,270
and your lineage flourish for generations!

426
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,210
Bow to heaven and earth!

427
00:28:39,110 --> 00:28:41,000
First bow to heaven and earth!

428
00:28:42,510 --> 00:28:43,480
Bow!

429
00:28:59,350 --> 00:29:03,000
They have yet to tie the knot, have they?

430
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:06,640
Bring it here.

431
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:19,270
This...

432
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:21,510
This is...

433
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:28,920
I told you

434
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:30,830
your marriage is

435
00:29:32,750 --> 00:29:34,590
more important than my life.

436
00:29:50,790 --> 00:29:52,960
Second bow to the parents!

437
00:29:56,790 --> 00:29:57,750
Bow!

438
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,680
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

439
00:30:15,270 --> 00:30:16,270
Bow!

440
00:30:33,750 --> 00:30:35,880
The ceremony is complete!

441
00:30:36,590 --> 00:30:38,640
Bravo! Bravo!

442
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:39,160
Congratulations!

443
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:41,720
-Bravo!
-Congratulations!

444
00:30:42,120 --> 00:30:44,120
Have a long and happy life together!

445
00:31:00,790 --> 00:31:01,720
Qingyuan.

446
00:31:03,310 --> 00:31:04,200
From now on,

447
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:06,270
you are my wife.

448
00:31:09,310 --> 00:31:10,110
Wait a minute!

449
00:31:38,270 --> 00:31:39,590
Why did you start

450
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:40,650
without the bride?

451
00:31:41,790 --> 00:31:42,750
Qingyuan?

452
00:31:42,820 --> 00:31:44,280
Who's under the veil then?

453
00:32:29,590 --> 00:32:30,400
An impostor?

454
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:01,110
My son,

455
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:02,590
I...

456
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:15,510
I'll go check on Qingru.

457
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,350
Qingyuan!

458
00:34:17,190 --> 00:34:18,760
I apologize, Young Master Li.

459
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,219
Courtesy of someone else,

460
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,440
I'm a little late.

461
00:34:25,070 --> 00:34:25,800
Come with me!

462
00:34:26,670 --> 00:34:27,400
Father,

463
00:34:28,070 --> 00:34:29,330
from beginning to end,

464
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:30,510
the one I want to marry

465
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:31,710
is Xie Qingyuan.

466
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:32,670
She's here now.

467
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:34,620
Let's redo the wedding rites!

468
00:34:40,230 --> 00:34:41,360
You're out of line!

469
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:44,920
Since you've performed the wedding rites

470
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,670
with Second Lady Xie,

471
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:48,250
the two of you are

472
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,900
husband and wife for life!

473
00:34:50,230 --> 00:34:51,550
Everyone here's a witness.

474
00:34:51,550 --> 00:34:53,010
This isn't playing house!

475
00:35:00,110 --> 00:35:01,150
Lord Xie,

476
00:35:01,670 --> 00:35:05,070
we agreed on a marriage with Fourth Lady.

477
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:06,840
Why did it become Second Lady?

478
00:35:09,400 --> 00:35:12,480
Did we agree on Fourth Lady?

479
00:35:16,000 --> 00:35:17,510
Cut the crap!

480
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:19,120
Second Lady is the one

481
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:22,190
Madam Li and I have been
talking about all along.

482
00:35:22,190 --> 00:35:24,420
Weren't you aware, Your Lordship?

483
00:35:24,510 --> 00:35:25,920
No, I wasn't!

484
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:34,000
When my elder brother arrives,

485
00:35:34,230 --> 00:35:35,690
Madam Li and I will give you

486
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:38,110
a proper explanation, Your Lordship.

487
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:52,550
When will Commissioner Hu arrive?

488
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:55,360
My brother said

489
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:58,080
he couldn't miss
his niece's wedding banquet.

490
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:04,360
Then how should we handle

491
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:05,550
this situation?

492
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:07,460
Calm down, Your Lordship.

493
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:08,510
Take a seat.

494
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:13,030
Li.

495
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,140
Don't touch me!

496
00:36:19,710 --> 00:36:20,910
The marquis is right.

497
00:36:21,510 --> 00:36:22,910
The ceremony is complete

498
00:36:23,150 --> 00:36:24,350
and cannot be undone.

499
00:36:24,360 --> 00:36:26,160
I don't care about the ceremony!

500
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:27,960
I've sworn to marry Xie Qingyuan.

501
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:30,480
I'll give up my position
as Marquis of Danyang's heir

502
00:36:30,480 --> 00:36:31,510
before I yield.

503
00:36:35,070 --> 00:36:36,000
Young Master Li.

504
00:36:42,590 --> 00:36:43,450
Your Lordship,

505
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,710
since things have come to this,

506
00:36:45,710 --> 00:36:47,560
I have a suggestion which

507
00:36:47,630 --> 00:36:50,000
both fulfills Young Master Li's wish

508
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:52,630
and brings our two families closer.

509
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:56,360
Why don't Young Master Li

510
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:59,320
take Qingyuan as a concubine today?

511
00:37:00,230 --> 00:37:02,510
Wouldn't that be a double blessing?

512
00:37:09,070 --> 00:37:09,630
No!

513
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:11,320
My pledge to marry

514
00:37:11,760 --> 00:37:12,920
Qingyuan as my wife

515
00:37:13,630 --> 00:37:14,490
is set in stone.

516
00:37:16,400 --> 00:37:17,400
Young Master Li,

517
00:37:17,710 --> 00:37:20,710
you should give it some serious thought.

518
00:37:22,110 --> 00:37:24,630
Qingyuan crashed the wedding hall

519
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:26,440
in her wedding dress

520
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:29,400
after you completed the ceremony.

521
00:37:29,670 --> 00:37:32,190
This act brings disgrace to our family

522
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:34,160
and violates moral principles.

523
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:36,320
If you don't take her as a concubine,

524
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:37,960
the Xie household

525
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,840
cannot keep her either.

526
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:41,360
We'll have no choice

527
00:37:41,880 --> 00:37:44,630
but to send her to a nunnery
outside the city

528
00:37:45,070 --> 00:37:46,440
to become a nun.

529
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:50,550
For the rest of her life,
she'll never be able to

530
00:37:50,630 --> 00:37:52,430
step out of those nunnery gates.

531
00:38:00,670 --> 00:38:03,670
But if you take her as a concubine,

532
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:06,590
wouldn't you be able to protect her?

533
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:10,920
Can you really bear to see her end up

534
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:13,070
in such a place of hardship?

535
00:38:28,110 --> 00:38:29,110
Your Lordship,

536
00:38:29,710 --> 00:38:31,920
this matter cannot be delayed.

537
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:34,150
If word gets out,

538
00:38:34,360 --> 00:38:36,760
it'll be disastrous for both our families.

539
00:38:37,190 --> 00:38:38,400
By then,

540
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:40,230
we won't be able to help her

541
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,760
even if we want to.

542
00:38:42,550 --> 00:38:43,410
Your Lordship,

543
00:38:44,030 --> 00:38:45,030
what do you think?

544
00:38:56,030 --> 00:38:57,030
My child,

545
00:38:57,630 --> 00:38:59,480
do you really have the heart

546
00:38:59,670 --> 00:39:02,550
to drive Qingyuan into a corner?

547
00:39:06,030 --> 00:39:08,480
If you truly care for her, you should know

548
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:10,440
which is more important:

549
00:39:10,880 --> 00:39:12,110
the title of wife

550
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:14,190
or the rest of her life.

551
00:39:24,030 --> 00:39:25,000
Qingyuan.

552
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:30,190
I...

553
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:33,460
I don't want to see you suffer.

554
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:34,840
But I...

555
00:39:35,760 --> 00:39:36,400
But I...

556
00:39:39,360 --> 00:39:40,820
That day at the snack shop,

557
00:39:41,150 --> 00:39:42,750
you swore to heaven that

558
00:39:43,150 --> 00:39:44,880
you'd marry only me as your wife

559
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,840
and never take a concubine.

560
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:47,920
I thought you were

561
00:39:48,550 --> 00:39:49,950
different from other men

562
00:39:50,070 --> 00:39:51,880
who take multiple wives and concubines,

563
00:39:51,880 --> 00:39:54,320
causing unrest in the household.

564
00:39:58,710 --> 00:39:59,230
No,

565
00:39:59,510 --> 00:40:00,000
I...

566
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:00,930
Young Master Li,

567
00:40:01,550 --> 00:40:02,320
I know

568
00:40:02,590 --> 00:40:03,980
you didn't mean to

569
00:40:04,020 --> 00:40:05,280
break your promise.

570
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:07,800
But since you're already married,

571
00:40:07,800 --> 00:40:09,460
it means we're not meant to be.

572
00:40:09,770 --> 00:40:12,430
You don't need to insist on
marrying me anymore.

573
00:40:26,440 --> 00:40:28,000
Enough, Qingyuan.

574
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:31,380
Stop being unreasonable, okay?

575
00:40:31,710 --> 00:40:33,230
Marriage is decided by the parents

576
00:40:33,230 --> 00:40:34,670
and arranged by a matchmaker.

577
00:40:34,670 --> 00:40:36,930
There's no room for private betrothals!

578
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:40,530
Young Master Li's feelings for you
are sincere.

579
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:42,370
Instead of being grateful,

580
00:40:42,440 --> 00:40:44,550
why are you being so aggressive?

581
00:40:45,510 --> 00:40:46,280
That day,

582
00:40:46,630 --> 00:40:49,740
I only agreed to the marriage
because the heir swore

583
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:51,360
to marry me as his wife.

584
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:52,670
Now,

585
00:40:53,000 --> 00:40:54,200
I've kept my promise,

586
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:56,090
but he married someone else.

587
00:40:56,110 --> 00:40:58,190
I just want to cancel the engagement.

588
00:40:58,440 --> 00:41:00,100
How's that being aggressive?

589
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:09,280
Fine.

590
00:41:12,070 --> 00:41:14,170
My Lord and Your Lordship,

591
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:15,900
please make the decision.

592
00:41:24,400 --> 00:41:25,070
Li.

593
00:41:36,510 --> 00:41:37,310
It's decided.

594
00:41:37,840 --> 00:41:39,630
After a discussion with Li,

595
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:41,000
we'll do

596
00:41:41,590 --> 00:41:42,670
as you proposed.

597
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:45,920
What a brilliant idea,

598
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:46,800
My Lady.

599
00:41:47,440 --> 00:41:51,510
Good things come in pairs, don't they?

600
00:41:51,760 --> 00:41:54,610
Let auspiciousness beget auspiciousness.

601
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:55,880
As the saying goes,

602
00:41:55,880 --> 00:41:57,320
there's no time like the present.

603
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:59,510
This is a foolproof plan.

604
00:42:00,670 --> 00:42:01,510
Qingyuan,

605
00:42:01,760 --> 00:42:02,880
do as we say.

606
00:42:03,110 --> 00:42:05,960
If you don't marry into
the marquis's family today,

607
00:42:05,960 --> 00:42:07,190
in the future,

608
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:09,410
who would dare to marry you?

609
00:42:11,840 --> 00:42:12,360
Yes.

610
00:42:17,000 --> 00:42:18,800
So what if no one marries me?

611
00:42:19,190 --> 00:42:20,510
I can live well

612
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:22,550
on my own.

613
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:29,970
I'd rather spend the remainder of my life
in monastic seclusion

614
00:42:30,110 --> 00:42:31,670
than submit to being a concubine!
